# Hand-derived names and descriptions for the RT12_3.10.06 firmware.
# Each FUNCS entry: address -> (name, description).  Evidence level in the description
# where it matters: "verified" = read the code; "signature" = matches the Realtek SDK
# prototype; "from string" = named after a log/tag string it contains.

